<p class=MsoNormal align=center dir=RTL style='text-align:center'><b><span
lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;color:red'>วแ๚ศว๑ศว๑๕ 
วแ๚ใ๖ฦ๓ษ๕ ๆ๓วแำ๘๓วศ๖ฺ๓ ฺ๓ิ๓ั๓</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL style='text-align:justify;text-justify:kashida;
text-kashida:0%'><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><b><span lang=AR-SA style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;
color:red'>117. ิไๆฯษ วแหวแห</span></b></p>

<div align=right dir=rtl>

<table class=MsoNormalTable dir=rtl border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0
 style='border-collapse:collapse;border:none'>
 <tr>
  <td width=189 valign=top style='width:5.0cm;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 1.4pt 0cm 1.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><b><span lang=AR-SA style='
  font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;color:blue'>วแๆุไ วแรีแํ<br>
  วแรำใ Þศแ วแศุัํั฿ํษ<br>
  <br>
  วแฯํั วแใสฮัฬ ใไๅ<br>
  สวัํฮ วแสÞฯใษ<br>
  ใอแ รÞวใษ วแศุัํั฿ ใฯษ วแัฦวำษ </span></b></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><b><span lang=AR-SA style='
  font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;color:blue'>วแใแๆ฿ วแใฺวีัๆไ</span></b></p>
  </td>
  <td width=287 valign=top style='width:215.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  border-right:none;padding:0cm 1.4pt 0cm 1.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><b><span lang=AR-SA style='
  font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;color:#993300'>รำํๆุ<br>
  &nbsp;ไุํั ฬํฯ Þศแ วแัๅศไษ ๆวแÞำ รไุๆไํๆำ วแำัํวไํ ศฺฯๅว</span></b></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><b><span lang=AR-SA style='
  font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;color:#993300'>&nbsp;ๆวแรไศว ิไๆฯษ รำÞÝ ฺวใ วแสฺแํใ 
  ๆ วแใฺวๅฯ วแฯํไํษ</span></b></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><b><span lang=AR-SA style='
  font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;color:#993300'>&nbsp;วแำัํวไ<br>
  &nbsp;4 ๅวสๆั 1688 แแิๅฯวม - 14 ไๆÝใศั 1971 แแใํแวฯ<br>
  &nbsp;วแรไศว ัๆํำ ศวแฺศวำํษ</span></b></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><b><span lang=AR-SA style='
  font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;color:#993300'>รไๆั วแำวฯวสก ๆอำไ์ ใศวั฿</span></b></p>
