<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ สวัํฮ วแใํแวฯ: </span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
4</span><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
</span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
ไๆÝใศั</span><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
</span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
1952</span><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>ใ.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ ใ฿วไ วแใํแวฯ: </span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
วแใไีๆัษ</span><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
- ใอวÝูษ </span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
วแฯÞๅแํษ</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ วแวำใ Þศแ วแัๅศไษ: </span><span class="auto-style3">ๆฬํๅ ีศอํ ศวÞํ ำแํใวไ</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ วแสอÞ ศฬวใฺษ </span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
วแวำ฿ไฯัํษ</span><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
- </span><span class="auto-style3">฿แํษ วแีํฯแษ</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ ฯัำ </span><span class="auto-style3">วแีํฯแษ ๆวแฺแๆใ</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ อีแ ฺแ์ </span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
วแศ฿วแๆัํๆำ</span><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
ศสÞฯํั (</span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>ฬํฯ ฬฯว๐ ใฺ ใัสศษ 
วแิัÝ</span><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>) ฺวใ 19</span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>75</span><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>ใ.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ วแสอÞ ศวแ฿แํษ วแล฿แํั฿ํๅ Ýํ </span>
<span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
วแวำ฿ไฯัํษ</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ สฮัฬ ใไ วแ฿แํษ วแล฿แํั฿ํษ </span>
<span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
ฺวใ 1983ใ.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ อีแ ฺแ์ าใวแษ ๅํฦษ วแีอษ วแฺวแใํษ ศลไฬแสัว&nbsp;ำไษ 
1985</a>&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ ฺใแ ฿ีํฯแํ สวศฺ แใฤำำวส ๆาวัษ วแีอษ </span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ สัๅศไ ํๆใ วแรอฯ วแใๆวÝÞ 31 ํๆแํๆ ฺวใ&nbsp;1988</a>&nbsp;ใ. 
ๆ฿วไ&nbsp;วแศวศว 
ิไๆฯๅ</a>&nbsp;ๅๆ วแะํ วฮสวั แๅ วำใ &quot;หํๆฯๆั&quot; .</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+
</span><span dir=LTR></span><span lang=AR-EG dir=LTR><span dir=LTR></span>&nbsp;</span><span
lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>ัำใ Þำว๐ Ý์ </span>
<span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>23</span><span
lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'> </span>
<span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>ฯํำใศั</span><span
lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'> 19</span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>8</span><span
lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>8ใ.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ วไสÞแ แแฮฯใษ ศใอวÝูษ วแศอํัษ (ลํศวัิํษ วแศอํัษ ศฯใไๅๆั -ศฺฯ ัำวใสๅ ฿วๅไ๐ว 
ศิๅัํไ- Ýํ ํๆใ วแฮใํำ วแใๆวÝÞ 15 Ýศัวํั </span>
<span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
1990ใ.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ ไวแ ฯัฬษ วแรำÞÝ Ýํ 15 ํๆไํๆ&nbsp;1997</a>&nbsp;(Ýํ 
ฺํฯ วแฺไีัษ)ก ฿รำÞÝ ฺวใ๐ว แใำวฺฯษ </span>
<span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
ไํวÝษ วแวไศว ศวฮๆใํๆำ ใุัวไ วแศอํัษ ๆใุัๆอ</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ Þวใ ศฯัวำษ &quot;วแสฺแํใ วแใำํอํ ๆวแลฯวัษ&quot; Ýํ ำไÛวÝๆัษ&nbsp;ำไษ 
1999</a>. </span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ ำํใ รำÞÝว๐ ฺวใว๐ แแสฺแํใ ๆวแใฺวๅฯ วแฯํไํษ ศวำใ วแรไศว ิไๆฯๅ Ýํ 30 ำศสใศั 
1962ใ.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ ัำใ รำÞÝว๐ ฺวใว๐ แแสฺแํใ Ýํ ำศสใศั 1962ใ.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal dir=RTL><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
+ ศฺฯ ไํวอษ วแศวศว </span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
ิไๆฯษ</span><span lang=AR-EG style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
Ýํ </span><span style='font-family:"\.Arabic UI Text Medium";line-height:2.0;'>
