 depending on the contract.  ฅ Once your license has expired, you MUST delete all Hacen fonts from your system.    Furthermore, we offer freeware fonts as well, you can use them without need to get a license. If the font is free, a notice is shown on its main page, for example CAPSpice is freeware.     Understanding What Is A Font    Hacen Arabic fonts are wholly made through an extensive design process, we hope that our valuable users consider the large amount of time given to produce these fonts. We work hard to provide our customers with high quality fonts, thus, by abiding by this agreement, you encourage us to keep on working better. Please understand that:    ฅ The design included in the font itself (software), is copyrighted by Hacen, any copying, redrawing, or rendering to match or imitate the shape of the original font is a breach of copyright law. (Such as: Using font editors to copy the glyphs (design) of the font into other tables or formats under new names).    ฅ Fonts are computer software, the TrueType format and the file (code) that includes the artistic design of the font is copyrighted.    ฅ The table used in our fonts is exclusively developed for Hacen, it is also copyrighted.      We are concerned about piracy issues, and absolutely, your support will help us to go forward in our HacenType project for the sake of Arabic typography.www.hacen.net/en/font_license.html␀ฉ␀ ␀2␀0␀0␀5␀-␀2␀0␀1␀6␀ ␀H␀a␀c␀e␀n␀T␀y␀p␀e␀,␀ ␀A␀l␀l␀ ␀R␀i␀g␀h␀t␀s␀ ␀R␀e␀s␀e␀r␀v␀e␀d␀.␀R␀e␀g␀u␀l␀a␀r␀H␀a␀c␀e␀n␀ ␀S␀a␀h␀a␀r␀a␀ ␀S␀t␀:␀V␀e␀r␀s␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀1␀.␀0␀0␀V␀e␀r␀s␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀1␀.␀0␀0␀ ␀J␀u␀n␀e␀ ␀9␀,␀ ␀2␀0␀1␀6␀H␀a␀c␀e␀n␀S␀a␀h␀a␀r␀a␀S␀t␀M␀o␀h␀a␀m␀e␀d␀ ␀H␀a␀c␀e␀n␀ ␀M␀o␀t␀t␀a␀l␀y␀H␀A␀C␀E␀N␀T␀Y␀P␀E␀ ␀E␀N␀D␀ ␀U␀S␀E␀R␀ ␀L␀I␀C␀E␀N␀S␀E␀ ␀A␀G␀R␀E␀E␀M␀E␀N␀T␀␀
